From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nydal91 <nydal91@hotmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 15:49:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 04/18] Add SGSR 2 upscaler backend for DX12

Run the same Convert and Upscale shaders on DX12 and offer sgsr2 as a
Dx12Upscaler. The constant calculation moves to SGSR2ConstantBuilder so
both APIs share it.

The passes keep their own constants and descriptor heaps per frame in
flight, since the GPU can still be reading the previous frame's jitter.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01A9WqnwGsLAcGJXd49N2pes
